+A binding's buffer (FindBindingBuffer) that the host has no memory to record (the slot table or the buffer object refused, std::bad_alloc) reads nothing for that draw or dispatch, as one the device refused does already (BufferCacheRuntime::RefusedBuffersAllowed), instead of ending the session: Ocarina of Time loading Castle Town on the PS5 (20 Nov) ended in std::terminate for a 1 KiB uniform buffer. Nothing was joined yet when it is refused. Other callers still see the refusal, named in the log.
+
+diff --git a/src/video_core/buffer_cache/buffer_cache.h b/src/video_core/buffer_cache/buffer_cache.h
+index a4425cf..661a649 100644
